    "faq": {
      "type": "sol-faq-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is milk thistle?",
            "answer": "<p>Milk thistle is a plant-based supplement known for its active compound <strong>silymarin</strong>, which supports liver detox, reduced fatigue and many other health benefits.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it actually work?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. This formula supports cleansing with natural ingredients. Milk thistle helps your body clear buildup, while inositol and turmeric help reduce bloating and give you steady energy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long before I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Most people notice changes within days. <strong>Days 1–5:</strong> lighter digestion, less bloating, steadier energy. <strong>Weeks 2–3:</strong> clearer skin, more energy. <strong>Week 4+:</strong> a noticeably flatter, lighter feeling.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this just for men?",
            "answer": "<p>No. This cleanse is effective for both men and women who want relief from digestive issues and increased vitality. The formula delivers results regardless of gender.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-16": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Who is it for?",
            "answer": "<p>SOLVANNO is for anyone who wants to support their liver, ease bloating and feel more energised — whether you drink occasionally, eat a typical modern diet, or simply want to give your body's natural detox system a hand. It's made for both men and women and works alongside your normal routine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I take it?",
            "answer": "<p>Take 1 capsule daily with water, preferably with a meal. For best results, take it at the same time each day to keep your system balanced.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-17": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does one bottle last?",
            "answer": "<p>Each bottle contains 60 capsules — a 30-day supply at one capsule daily. Many customers choose a 3–6 month supply, since liver support builds with consistent use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need to change my diet or quit drinking?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>No.</strong> You don't need to quit drinking or go on a crash diet to feel a difference. Cutting back on alcohol and processed food will help your liver further, but you'll still feel noticeable benefits from SOLVANNO alone.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the best time to take this?",
            "answer": "<p>The morning is ideal — it gives you a strong, steady start to your day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes SOLVANNO different?",
            "answer": "<p>Our milk thistle is standardised to <strong>80% silymarin</strong>, the clinical threshold. We use 8 active ingredients that protect and detox at the same time, and we source naturally under strict standards.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this safe? Any side effects?",
            "answer": "<p>SOLVANNO is made with 100% natural, plant-based ingredients — vegan, non-GMO and free from harsh additives. Third-party lab tested. Consult your healthcare provider if you're pregnant, nursing or on medication.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-10": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will this work if I've tried other supplements before?",
            "answer": "<p>Most liver supplements only address one piece of the problem. SOLVANNO's 8-ingredient formula supports the full cycle — which is why customers who gave up on other products often see results here.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-12": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it doesn't work for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Every order is protected by our <strong>90-day money-back guarantee</strong>. No questions, no hassle. If you don't feel the difference, we'll refund every cent.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-13": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How fast is shipping?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders ship free over $50 and arrive within 3–5 business days across the US, with a tracking link emailed to you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-14": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is checkout secure?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Checkout is fully encrypted and processed through a secure gateway. We accept all major cards, PayPal, Apple Pay and Shop Pay.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-15": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I get in touch?",
            "answer": "<p>Email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@solvanno.com\">support@solvanno.com</a> and our support team will get back to you quickly.</p>"
          }
        }
